    <sec id="s1">
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>The growth rate is <inline-formula><tex-math>r = \frac{\ln 2}{t_d}</tex-math></inline-formula> for a doubling time t.</p>
      <p>The first formula is written in MathML:</p>
      <disp-formula id="e1">
        <label>(1)</label>
        <mml:math display="block"><mml:mrow><mml:msup><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:msup><mml:mo>+</mml:mo><mml:msup><mml:mi>b</mml:mi><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:msup><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:msup><mml:mi>c</mml:mi><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:msup></mml:mrow></mml:math>
      </disp-formula>
      <p>The second formula is written in TeX:</p>
      <disp-formula id="e2">
        <label>(2)</label>
        <tex-math>\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}</tex-math>
      </disp-formula>
      <p>The end of the section.</p>
    </sec>
